1
00:00:00,957 --> 00:00:05,497
(Raj:)In the last two hours,
162 women have read our profiles.

2
00:00:05,561 --> 00:00:06,971
(Raj:)How many of them
have sent us messages?

3
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:08,370
(Stuart:)-Combined?
-Yes.

4
00:00:08,498 --> 00:00:10,168
(Stuart:)Zero.

5
00:00:12,869 --> 00:00:14,409
(Raj:)Dude, this is... this is brutal.

6
00:00:14,537 --> 00:00:17,707
(Stuart:)I don't think I've ever felt
so rejected.

7
00:00:17,807 --> 00:00:21,687
(Stuart:)And I had a rescue dog
who ran back to the pound.

8
00:00:23,913 --> 00:00:25,513
(Raj:)This is the worst.

9
00:00:25,648 --> 00:00:26,888
(Raj:)If we're gonna get shot down,

10
00:00:26,983 --> 00:00:29,363
(Raj:)we might as well just go to a bar
and do it old-school.

11
00:00:29,419 --> 00:00:32,989
(Stuart:)-And make them look us in the eye.
-Yeah, anything is better than this.

12
00:00:33,556 --> 00:00:35,726
(Amy(on webcam):)-Hello.
-Not interested.

13
00:00:36,025 --> 00:00:37,695
I (POP MUSIC PLAYS) I

14
00:00:38,828 --> 00:00:40,938
(Raj:)I was wrong. This is worse.

15
00:00:45,068 --> 00:00:47,608
I (INDIANA JONES THEME PLAYS) I

16
00:00:50,106 --> 00:00:52,416
(Howard:)Wait, wait.
If it wasn't for Indiana Jones,

17
00:00:52,508 --> 00:00:54,388
(Howard:)the ark would never have ended up
at the warehouse!

18
00:00:54,510 --> 00:00:56,350
That's true!

19
00:00:56,412 --> 00:01:00,522
(Sheldon:)He collected and delivered the ark
to the proper authorities for filing.

20
00:01:00,550 --> 00:01:02,260
-Like a hero!
-Yes!

21
00:01:05,254 --> 00:01:07,734
(Leonard:)Although, technically,
Indy was supposed to take the ark

22
00:01:07,790 --> 00:01:10,270
(Leonard:)to a museum to be studied.
He couldn't even get that done.

23
00:01:12,295 --> 00:01:14,935
(ALL GRUMBLE)

